WEBVTT

00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:40.737
You boys really screwed up this time.

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:45.770
Where is he?

00:01:47.637 --> 00:01:49.770
You're never gonna
see your father again.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.371
They've got dad.

00:01:55.404 --> 00:01:56.737
Meg?

00:01:57.971 --> 00:01:59.137
What did she say?

00:01:59.171 --> 00:02:00.870
I just told you, sammy.

00:02:02.237 --> 00:02:06.670
Okay.

00:02:11.637 --> 00:02:13.770
What are you doing, dean?

00:02:13.804 --> 00:02:15.971
We got to go.

00:02:16.004 --> 00:02:17.971
Why?

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:20.137
Because the demon knows
we're in salvation.

00:02:20.171 --> 00:02:21.770
It knows we've got the colt.

00:02:21.804 --> 00:02:23.438
It's probably coming for us next.

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:25.603
We've still got three bullets left.

00:02:25.637 --> 00:02:27.404
Listen, tough guy, we're not ready.

00:02:27.438 --> 00:02:29.603
We don't know how many
of them are out there.

00:02:29.637 --> 00:02:31.770
We're no good to anybody dead.

00:02:31.804 --> 00:02:34.371
We're leaving...now.

00:02:41.603 --> 00:02:45.503
I'm telling you, dean,
we could've taken him.

00:02:45.537 --> 00:02:46.971
What we need is a plan.

00:02:47.004 --> 00:02:49.503
They're keeping dad alive.
We've got to figure out where.

00:02:49.537 --> 00:02:52.171
They're gonna want to
trade him for the gun.

00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:54.470
What?

00:02:54.503 --> 00:02:57.271
If that were true, why
didn't meg mention a trade?

00:02:59.338 --> 00:03:02.371
Dad, he might be -

00:03:02.404 --> 00:03:04.537
I don't want to believe
it any more than you,

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:08.338
But if he is, all the more
reason to kill this damn thing.

00:03:08.371 --> 00:03:10.804
We still have the colt. We
can still finish the job.

00:03:10.837 --> 00:03:12.004
Screw the job, sam!

00:03:12.037 --> 00:03:14.171
Dean, i'm just trying
to do what he would want.

00:03:14.204 --> 00:03:18.004
Would you quit talking about
him like he's dead already?

00:03:18.037 --> 00:03:19.171
Listen to me.

00:03:19.204 --> 00:03:21.670
Everything stops until we get him back.

00:03:21.704 --> 00:03:23.004
Everything.

00:03:26.904 --> 00:03:28.204
So, how do we find him?

00:03:28.237 --> 00:03:29.537
Maybe we go to lincoln.

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.804
Start at the warehouse
where he was taken.

00:03:31.837 --> 00:03:34.237
You really think these demons
are gonna leave a trail?

00:03:34.271 --> 00:03:36.438
You're right.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:39.971
We need help.

00:04:05.737 --> 00:04:07.737
Here you go.

00:04:09.804 --> 00:04:11.438
What is this
- Holy water?

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:13.804
That one is. This is whiskey.

00:04:19.804 --> 00:04:23.071
Bobby, thanks. Thanks for everything.

00:04:23.104 --> 00:04:25.570
To tell you the truth, i
wasn't sure if we should come.

00:04:25.603 --> 00:04:27.404
Nonsense. Your daddy needs help.

00:04:27.438 --> 00:04:28.603
The last time we saw you,

00:04:28.637 --> 00:04:30.804
You did threaten to blast
him full of buckshot.

00:04:30.837 --> 00:04:32.637
You cocked the shotgun and everything.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:35.470
Yeah, well, what can i say?

00:04:35.503 --> 00:04:37.537
John just has that effect on people.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:40.104
Yeah, i guess he does.

00:04:40.137 --> 00:04:41.438
None of that matters now.

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:44.104
All that matters is
that you get him back.

00:04:44.137 --> 00:04:46.271
Bobby, this book.

00:04:46.304 --> 00:04:48.603
I've never seen anything like it.

00:04:48.637 --> 00:04:53.271
Key of solomon? It's
the real deal, all right.

00:04:53.304 --> 00:04:56.470
And these protective circles
- They really work?

00:04:56.503 --> 00:04:57.537
Hell yeah.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:01.104
You get a demon in one, they're trapped.

00:05:01.137 --> 00:05:05.071
They're powerless. It's
like a satanic roach motel.

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:06.570
Dean: the man knows his stuff.

00:05:06.603 --> 00:05:10.570
I'll tell you something else, too.

00:05:10.603 --> 00:05:14.071
This is some serious
crap you boys stepped in.

00:05:14.104 --> 00:05:17.570
Oh, yeah? How's that?

00:05:17.603 --> 00:05:21.770
Normal year, i hear, say,
three demonic possessions,

00:05:21.804 --> 00:05:23.804
Maybe four, tops.

00:05:23.837 --> 00:05:27.237
This year, i heard of 27 so far.

00:05:27.271 --> 00:05:28.804
You get what i'm saying?

00:05:28.837 --> 00:05:33.637
More and more demons are walking among us
- A lot more.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:36.537
Do you know why?

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.870
No, but i know it's something big.

00:05:38.904 --> 00:05:44.037
The storm's coming, and
you boys, your daddy -

00:05:44.071 --> 00:05:46.470
You are smack in the middle of it.

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:53.304
Rumsfeld.

00:05:53.338 --> 00:05:54.670
What is it?

00:05:59.404 --> 00:06:01.404
Something's wrong.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:09.004
No more crap, okay?

00:06:17.837 --> 00:06:22.804
I want the colt,
sam - The real colt -

00:06:22.837 --> 00:06:26.304
Right now.

00:06:26.338 --> 00:06:28.704
We don't have it on us. We buried it.

00:06:28.737 --> 00:06:30.237
Didn't i say "no more crap"?

00:06:30.271 --> 00:06:33.371
I swear
- After everything i heard about you winchesters,

00:06:33.404 --> 00:06:36.804
I've got to tell you,
i'm a little underwhelmed.

00:06:36.837 --> 00:06:40.004
First johnny tries to
pawn off a fake gun,

00:06:40.037 --> 00:06:43.870
And then he leaves the real
gun with you two chuckleheads.

00:06:43.904 --> 00:06:45.404
Lackluster, men.

00:06:45.438 --> 00:06:51.603
I mean, did you really
think i wouldn't find you?

00:06:55.104 --> 00:06:58.937
Actually, we were counting on it.

00:07:12.404 --> 00:07:14.503
Gotcha.

00:07:28.438 --> 00:07:33.237
You know, if you wanted to tie me up,

00:07:33.271 --> 00:07:35.438
All you had to do was ask.

00:07:38.603 --> 00:07:40.737
I salted the doors and windows.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:43.770
If there are any demons out
there, they ain't getting in.

00:07:51.371 --> 00:07:53.171
Where's our father, meg?

00:07:53.204 --> 00:07:55.937
You didn't ask very nice.

00:07:55.971 --> 00:07:57.503
Where's our father, bitch?

00:07:57.537 --> 00:08:01.670
Jeez. You kiss your
mother with that mouth?

00:08:01.704 --> 00:08:04.438
Oh, i forgot. You don't.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:06.737
You think this is a freaking game?!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.637
Where is he?! What did you do to him?!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:13.137
He died screaming. I killed him myself.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:27.670
That's kind of a turn-On
- You hitting a girl.

00:08:27.704 --> 00:08:29.304
You're no girl.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.904
Dean.

00:08:34.503 --> 00:08:36.470
You okay?

00:08:36.503 --> 00:08:37.870
She's lying. He's not dead.

00:08:37.904 --> 00:08:40.438
Dean, you've got to be careful
with her. Don't hurt her.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.171
Why?

00:08:42.204 --> 00:08:44.037
Because she really
is a girl. That's why.

00:08:44.071 --> 00:08:45.438
What are you talking about?

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.603
She's possessed.

00:08:46.637 --> 00:08:48.603
That's a human possessed by a demon.

00:08:48.637 --> 00:08:50.603
Can't you tell?

00:08:50.637 --> 00:08:53.438
Are you trying to tell me
there's an innocent girl

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:56.171
Trapped somewhere in there?

00:09:02.704 --> 00:09:05.037
That's actually good news.

00:09:17.171 --> 00:09:19.304
Are you gonna read me a story?

00:09:19.338 --> 00:09:23.037
Something like that. Hit it, sam.

00:09:23.071 --> 00:09:29.237
<i>"Regna terrae, cantTe
deo, psLlite dMino..."</i>

00:09:29.271 --> 00:09:33.404
An exorcism? Are you serious?

00:09:33.438 --> 00:09:35.271
We're going for it, baby
- Head spinning,

00:09:35.304 --> 00:09:37.904
Projectile vomiting,
the whole nine yards.

00:09:37.937 --> 00:09:40.470
<i>"Tribuite virtutem deo."</i>

00:09:47.104 --> 00:09:50.737
I'm gonna kill you.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:54.071
I'm gonna rip the bones from your body.

00:09:54.104 --> 00:09:56.237
No, you're gonna burn in hell

00:09:56.271 --> 00:09:58.237
Unless you tell us where our dad is.

00:10:00.537 --> 00:10:04.271
Well, at least you'll get a nice tan.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:10.937
<i>"Exorcizamus te, omnis
immundus spiritus,</i>

00:10:10.971 --> 00:10:14.204
<i>"Omnis satanica potestas,</i>

00:10:14.237 --> 00:10:17.071
<i>"Omnis incursio infernalis
adversarii, omnis legio,</i>

00:10:17.104 --> 00:10:20.071
<i>"Omnis congregatio et secta diabolica."</i>

00:10:20.104 --> 00:10:21.404
Aah!

00:10:22.404 --> 00:10:27.537
He begged for his life
with tears in his eyes.

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:31.404
He begged to see his sons one last time.

00:10:31.438 --> 00:10:33.204
That's when i slit his throat.

00:10:38.937 --> 00:10:39.904
<i>"Ergo..."</i>

00:10:39.937 --> 00:10:44.071
For your sake, i hope you're lying.

00:10:44.104 --> 00:10:46.304
'Cause if it's true, i swear to god,

00:10:46.338 --> 00:10:48.271
I will march into hell myself,

00:10:48.304 --> 00:10:50.704
And i will slaughter each and every one

00:10:50.737 --> 00:10:53.404
Of you evil sons of
bitches, so help me god.

00:10:53.438 --> 00:10:56.104
<i>"Perditionis venenum propinare.</i>

00:10:56.137 --> 00:11:02.937
<i>"Vade, satana, inventor et
magister omnis fallaciae,</i>

00:11:02.971 --> 00:11:05.770
<i>"Hostis humanae salutis.</i>

00:11:05.804 --> 00:11:09.271
<i>"Humiliare sub potenti manu
dei, contremisce et effuge,</i>

00:11:09.304 --> 00:11:13.004
<i>"Invocato a nobis sancto
et terribili nomine,</i>

00:11:13.037 --> 00:11:15.104
<i>Quem inferi tremunt."</i>

00:11:15.137 --> 00:11:16.603
Aah!

00:11:16.637 --> 00:11:17.971
Where is he?

00:11:19.837 --> 00:11:22.137
You just won't take "dead"
for an answer, will you?

00:11:22.171 --> 00:11:23.971
Where is he?!

00:11:24.004 --> 00:11:25.637
Dead! No, he's not!

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.570
He's not dead! He can't be!

00:11:31.037 --> 00:11:33.004
What are you looking at? Keep reading.

00:11:33.037 --> 00:11:36.171
<i>"Ab insidiis diaboli,
libera nos, domine.</i>

00:11:36.204 --> 00:11:41.704
<i>"Ut ecclesiam tuam secura
tibi facias libertate servire,</i>

00:11:41.737 --> 00:11:44.338
<i>Te rogamus, audi nos."</i>

00:11:44.371 --> 00:11:47.171
Aaaah!

00:11:47.204 --> 00:11:51.503
<i>"Ut inimicos sanctae
ecclesiae humiliare digneris,</i>

00:11:51.537 --> 00:11:53.304
<i>Te rogamus audi
-"</i>

00:11:53.338 --> 00:11:54.470
He will be!

00:11:54.503 --> 00:11:55.470
Wait! What?!

00:11:55.503 --> 00:11:57.037
He's not dead,

00:11:57.071 --> 00:12:00.304
But he will be after what we do to him.

00:12:01.904 --> 00:12:04.470
How do we know you're telling the truth?

00:12:04.503 --> 00:12:05.704
You don't.

00:12:05.737 --> 00:12:07.204
Sam! A building!

00:12:07.237 --> 00:12:09.971
Okay? A building in jefferson city.

00:12:10.004 --> 00:12:12.737
Missouri? Where, where? An address.

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:13.870
I don't know.

00:12:13.904 --> 00:12:15.503
And the demon
- Where is it?

00:12:15.537 --> 00:12:17.204
I don't know. I swear.

00:12:18.904 --> 00:12:21.904
That's everything. That's all i know.

00:12:26.304 --> 00:12:27.570
Finish it.

00:12:27.603 --> 00:12:29.404
What? I told you the truth.

00:12:29.438 --> 00:12:30.904
I don't care.

00:12:30.937 --> 00:12:32.404
You son of a bitch. You promised.

00:12:32.438 --> 00:12:34.737
I lied!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.603
Sam?

00:12:38.737 --> 00:12:40.570
Sam!

00:12:42.371 --> 00:12:44.171
Read.

00:12:44.204 --> 00:12:47.004
We can still use her, find
out where the demon is.

00:12:47.037 --> 00:12:48.338
She doesn't know.

00:12:48.371 --> 00:12:51.037
There's an innocent girl
trapped somewhere in there.

00:12:51.071 --> 00:12:52.637
We've got to help her.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.271
You're gonna kill her.

00:12:54.304 --> 00:12:55.438
What?

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:59.037
You said she fell from a building.

00:13:00.737 --> 00:13:03.237
That girl's body is broken.

00:13:03.271 --> 00:13:06.870
The only thing keeping her
alive is that demon inside.

00:13:06.904 --> 00:13:10.071
You exorcise it, the girl is gonna die.

00:13:10.104 --> 00:13:12.137
We are not gonna leave her like that.

00:13:12.171 --> 00:13:13.304
She is a human being.

00:13:13.338 --> 00:13:16.204
And we're gonna put
her out of her misery.

00:13:16.237 --> 00:13:18.704
Sam, finish it.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:30.304
Finish it.

00:13:37.271 --> 00:13:41.904
<i>"Dominicos sanctae ecclesiae.</i>

00:13:41.937 --> 00:13:43.570
<i>"Terogamus audi nos.</i>

00:13:43.603 --> 00:13:47.404
<i>"Terribilis deus de
sanctuario suo deus israhel</i>

00:13:47.438 --> 00:13:51.570
<i>"Ipse tribuite virtutem
et fortitudinem plebi suae.</i>

00:13:51.603 --> 00:13:54.271
<i>Benedictus deus. Gloria patri."</i>

00:14:30.004 --> 00:14:31.470
Dean: she's still alive.

00:14:31.503 --> 00:14:34.603
Call 911. Get some water and blankets.

00:14:37.704 --> 00:14:40.503
Thank you.

00:14:40.537 --> 00:14:43.171
Shh, shh, just take it easy, all right?

00:14:43.204 --> 00:14:44.371
Thank you.

00:14:44.404 --> 00:14:45.470
Shh.

00:14:45.503 --> 00:14:47.204
Come on. Let's get her down.

00:14:49.404 --> 00:14:52.870
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:52.904 --> 00:14:55.570
I've got you. I've got you.

00:14:55.603 --> 00:14:57.503
It's okay. It's okay.

00:14:57.537 --> 00:15:01.338
A year.

00:15:01.371 --> 00:15:02.870
What?

00:15:02.904 --> 00:15:04.870
It's been a year.

00:15:04.904 --> 00:15:07.171
Just take it easy.

00:15:07.204 --> 00:15:11.004
I've been awake for some of it.

00:15:14.637 --> 00:15:17.304
I couldn't move my own body.

00:15:18.904 --> 00:15:24.037
The things i did
- It's a nightmare.

00:15:24.071 --> 00:15:26.704
Was it telling us the
truth about our dad?

00:15:26.737 --> 00:15:28.537
Dean.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.770
We need to know.

00:15:29.804 --> 00:15:31.371
Yes.

00:15:33.104 --> 00:15:39.271
But it wants... you to know

00:15:39.304 --> 00:15:43.204
That...they want you to come for him.

00:15:43.237 --> 00:15:46.171
If dad's still alive,
none of that matters.

00:15:57.637 --> 00:15:59.637
Where is the demon we're looking for?

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:01.470
Not there.

00:16:01.503 --> 00:16:05.637
Other ones.

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.204
Awful ones.

00:16:08.338 --> 00:16:10.304
Where are they keeping our dad?

00:16:10.338 --> 00:16:14.904
By the r-River.

00:16:18.603 --> 00:16:20.937
Sunrise.

00:16:20.971 --> 00:16:23.271
"Sunrise"? What does that mean?

00:16:25.371 --> 00:16:27.704
What does that mean?

00:17:01.757 --> 00:17:02.357
You better hurry up and beat it

00:17:03.124 --> 00:17:04.791
Before the paramedics get here.

00:17:04.824 --> 00:17:06.323
What are you gonna tell them?

00:17:06.357 --> 00:17:09.323
You think you guys
invented lying to the cops?

00:17:09.357 --> 00:17:11.957
I'll figure something out.

00:17:11.991 --> 00:17:15.290
Here. Take this. You might need it.

00:17:15.323 --> 00:17:17.091
Thanks.

00:17:18.323 --> 00:17:21.557
Thanks...for everything.

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:23.024
Be careful, all right?

00:17:23.058 --> 00:17:24.490
Just go find your dad.

00:17:24.524 --> 00:17:27.757
And when you do, you bring
him around, would you?

00:17:27.791 --> 00:17:30.091
I won't even try to shoot him this time.

00:18:02.957 --> 00:18:04.957
You've been quiet.

00:18:06.891 --> 00:18:09.058
Just getting ready.

00:18:12.424 --> 00:18:15.424
He's gonna be fine, dean.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.857
Dude, what are you drawing on my car?

00:18:36.891 --> 00:18:39.857
It's called a devil's trap.

00:18:39.891 --> 00:18:42.190
Demons can't get
through it or inside it.

00:18:42.223 --> 00:18:43.557
So?

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:46.924
It basically turns the
trunk into a lockbox.

00:18:48.924 --> 00:18:50.724
So?

00:18:50.757 --> 00:18:53.724
So we have a place to hide
the colt while we go get dad.

00:18:53.757 --> 00:18:56.557
What are you talking about?
We're bringing the colt with us.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:57.891
We can't, dean.

00:18:57.924 --> 00:18:59.657
We've only got three bullets left.

00:18:59.691 --> 00:19:01.524
We can't just use them on any demon.

00:19:01.557 --> 00:19:03.190
<i>We've got to use them on the demon.</i>

00:19:03.223 --> 00:19:05.323
No, we have to save dad, sam, okay?

00:19:05.357 --> 00:19:07.757
We're gonna need all
the help we can get.

00:19:07.791 --> 00:19:10.357
You know how pissed dad would
be if we used all the bullets?

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:12.524
Dean, he wouldn't want
us to bring the gun.

00:19:12.557 --> 00:19:13.924
I don't care, sam!

00:19:13.957 --> 00:19:15.524
I don't care what dad wants, okay?

00:19:15.557 --> 00:19:17.357
Since when do you care what dad wants?

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:20.058
We want to kill this demon.
You used to want that, too.

00:19:20.091 --> 00:19:22.557
Hell, you're the one who
came and got me at school!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.390
You're the one who dragged me into this.

00:19:24.424 --> 00:19:26.158
I'm just trying to finish it.

00:19:31.424 --> 00:19:34.091
Well, you and dad are a lot
more alike than i thought.

00:19:34.124 --> 00:19:36.757
You both can't wait to sacrifice
yourself for this thing.

00:19:36.791 --> 00:19:39.691
But you know what? I'm
gonna be the one to bury you.

00:19:44.058 --> 00:19:45.524
You're selfish, you know that?

00:19:45.557 --> 00:19:47.857
You don't care about
anything but revenge.

00:19:47.891 --> 00:19:49.857
That's not true, dean.

00:19:49.891 --> 00:19:51.824
I want dad back,

00:19:51.857 --> 00:19:53.991
But they are expecting
us to bring this gun.

00:19:54.024 --> 00:19:56.323
They get the gun, they will kill us all.

00:19:56.357 --> 00:19:59.158
That colt is our only
leverage, and you know it, dean.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:02.757
We cannot bring that gun. We can't.

00:20:02.791 --> 00:20:04.624
Fine.

00:20:04.657 --> 00:20:07.223
I'm serious, dean. I said "fine," sam.

00:20:37.323 --> 00:20:39.624
Hey, hey.

00:20:39.657 --> 00:20:44.490
I think i know what
meg meant by "sunrise."

00:20:54.024 --> 00:20:57.457
Son of a bitch. That's pretty smart.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.290
If these demons can possess people,

00:20:59.323 --> 00:21:01.457
They can possess almost anybody inside.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:03.957
And make anybody attack us.

00:21:03.991 --> 00:21:05.290
And so we can't kill 'em -

00:21:05.323 --> 00:21:07.691
A building full of human shields.

00:21:07.724 --> 00:21:10.490
They probably know exactly
what we look like, too,

00:21:10.524 --> 00:21:12.457
And they could look like anybody.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:14.158
This sucks out loud.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:19.257
All right, so, how the
hell are we gonna get in?

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:25.024
Pull the fire alarm, get
out all the civilians.

00:21:25.058 --> 00:21:27.024
But then the city
responds in seven minutes.

00:21:27.058 --> 00:21:29.124
Seven minutes, exactly.

00:22:30.991 --> 00:22:32.457
You okay?

00:22:37.691 --> 00:22:39.323
Hey, what's happening? Is it a fire?

00:22:39.357 --> 00:22:41.158
We're figuring that out right now, sir.

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:42.657
Just stay back.

00:22:42.691 --> 00:22:45.158
I got a yorkie upstairs, and
he pees when he's nervous.

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:48.924
Sir, you have to stay back.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:11.158
I always wanted to be a
fireman when i grew up.

00:23:11.190 --> 00:23:13.323
You never told me that.

00:23:37.257 --> 00:23:40.757
This is the fire department.
We need you to evacuate.

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:11.590
Hurry up!

00:24:46.757 --> 00:24:48.158
Dad.

00:24:55.158 --> 00:24:57.390
He's still breathing.

00:24:57.424 --> 00:24:59.590
Dad, wake up.

00:24:59.624 --> 00:25:00.891
Dad!

00:25:04.158 --> 00:25:05.457
Wait. Wait.

00:25:05.490 --> 00:25:06.624
What?

00:25:06.657 --> 00:25:08.691
He could be possessed, for all we know.

00:25:08.724 --> 00:25:11.457
What, are you nuts?

00:25:11.490 --> 00:25:13.257
Dean, we got to be sure.

00:25:34.957 --> 00:25:37.624
Sam?

00:25:40.290 --> 00:25:43.124
Why are you splashing water on me?

00:25:44.857 --> 00:25:47.557
Dad, are you okay?

00:25:47.590 --> 00:25:51.091
They've been drugging me.

00:25:51.124 --> 00:25:52.757
Where's the colt?

00:25:52.791 --> 00:25:55.624
Don't worry, dad, it's safe.

00:25:57.223 --> 00:26:00.824
Good, boys. Good, boys.

00:26:20.323 --> 00:26:21.791
Hey, buddy, you can't go in.

00:26:35.557 --> 00:26:36.524
Go!

00:26:36.557 --> 00:26:37.524
Back, back!

00:26:37.557 --> 00:26:39.557
Go!

00:26:46.204 --> 00:26:48.737
Sam, let's go!

00:27:06.838 --> 00:27:08.671
Sam!

00:27:42.537 --> 00:27:44.170
Sam!

00:27:44.204 --> 00:27:47.437
Sam, come on. Come on.

00:27:56.370 --> 00:27:58.003
Come on.

00:27:58.037 --> 00:28:00.237
Come on, we've got to get out of here.

00:28:39.970 --> 00:28:41.437
How is he?

00:28:41.471 --> 00:28:44.103
He just needed a
little rest, that's all.

00:28:44.137 --> 00:28:47.103
How are you?

00:28:47.137 --> 00:28:51.970
[ Inhales deeply ] i'll survive.

00:28:54.103 --> 00:28:57.070
Hey, you don't think we
were followed here, do you?

00:28:57.103 --> 00:28:58.737
I don't know. I don't think so.

00:28:58.771 --> 00:28:59.804
We couldn't have found

00:28:59.838 --> 00:29:01.704
A more out-Of-The-Way
place to hole up.

00:29:01.737 --> 00:29:04.270
Yeah.

00:29:08.270 --> 00:29:09.938
Hey, uh...

00:29:12.571 --> 00:29:14.537
Dean, you, um...

00:29:17.437 --> 00:29:20.404
You saved my life back there.

00:29:20.437 --> 00:29:24.037
So i guess you're glad
i brought the gun, huh?

00:29:24.070 --> 00:29:28.204
Man, i'm trying to thank you here.

00:29:30.437 --> 00:29:32.604
You're welcome.

00:29:43.571 --> 00:29:45.037
Hey, sam?

00:29:45.070 --> 00:29:47.037
Yeah?

00:29:47.070 --> 00:29:50.204
You know that guy i shot?

00:29:50.237 --> 00:29:52.571
There was a person in there.

00:29:57.471 --> 00:29:59.938
You didn't have a choice, dean.

00:29:59.970 --> 00:30:03.270
I know. That's not what bothers me.

00:30:03.304 --> 00:30:06.804
Then what does?

00:30:10.904 --> 00:30:13.571
Killing that guy, killing meg.

00:30:15.571 --> 00:30:18.904
I didn't hesitate. I didn't even flinch.

00:30:21.504 --> 00:30:24.471
For you or dad, the things
i'm willing to do or kill,

00:30:24.504 --> 00:30:26.504
It's just...

00:30:28.838 --> 00:30:31.671
It scares me sometimes.

00:30:38.170 --> 00:30:41.804
It shouldn't.

00:30:41.838 --> 00:30:43.504
You did good.

00:30:43.537 --> 00:30:45.871
You're not mad?

00:30:45.904 --> 00:30:48.471
For what?

00:30:48.504 --> 00:30:50.804
Using a bullet.

00:30:52.604 --> 00:30:56.037
Mad? I'm proud of you.

00:30:57.671 --> 00:31:02.237
You know, sam and i, we
can get pretty obsessed.

00:31:02.270 --> 00:31:07.370
But you
- You watch out for this family.

00:31:07.404 --> 00:31:09.537
You always have.

00:31:15.970 --> 00:31:17.270
Thanks.

00:31:29.237 --> 00:31:32.170
It found us. It's here. The demon?

00:31:32.204 --> 00:31:34.637
Sam, lines of salt in front
of every window, ever door.

00:31:34.671 --> 00:31:35.970
Already did it.

00:31:36.003 --> 00:31:38.437
Check it, okay?

00:31:38.471 --> 00:31:40.771
Dean, you got the gun? Yeah.

00:31:40.804 --> 00:31:42.771
Give it to me. Sam
tried to shoot the demon.

00:31:42.804 --> 00:31:44.604
It vanished.

00:31:44.637 --> 00:31:48.904
I won't miss. Now, the gun. Hurry.

00:31:52.537 --> 00:31:55.070
Son, please.

00:32:01.970 --> 00:32:04.604
Give me the gun. What
are you doing, dean?

00:32:04.637 --> 00:32:06.170
You'd be furious.

00:32:06.204 --> 00:32:07.170
What?

00:32:07.204 --> 00:32:08.571
That i wasted a bullet.

00:32:08.604 --> 00:32:11.571
He wouldn't be proud of
me. He'd tear me a new one.

00:32:18.537 --> 00:32:21.304
You're not my dad.

00:32:24.604 --> 00:32:26.904
I know my dad better than anyone,

00:32:26.937 --> 00:32:28.737
And you ain't him.

00:32:28.770 --> 00:32:30.338
What the hell has gotten into you?

00:32:30.370 --> 00:32:32.503
I could ask you the same thing.

00:32:32.537 --> 00:32:35.670
Dean? What the hell is going on?

00:32:35.704 --> 00:32:37.670
Your brother's lost his mind.

00:32:37.704 --> 00:32:38.837
He's not dad.

00:32:38.871 --> 00:32:40.004
What?

00:32:40.037 --> 00:32:41.238
I think he's possessed.

00:32:41.271 --> 00:32:43.503
I think he's been possessed
since we rescued him.

00:32:43.537 --> 00:32:45.537
Don't listen to him.
Dean, how do you know?

00:32:45.570 --> 00:32:47.037
He's different.

00:32:47.071 --> 00:32:48.271
We don't have time for this.

00:32:48.304 --> 00:32:50.570
Sam, if you want to kill this demon,

00:32:50.604 --> 00:32:52.403
You've got to trust me.

00:32:57.271 --> 00:32:59.370
Sam?

00:33:06.470 --> 00:33:08.137
No.

00:33:10.071 --> 00:33:11.238
No.

00:33:20.904 --> 00:33:22.238
Fine.

00:33:23.971 --> 00:33:29.004
You're both so sure. Go ahead.

00:33:30.470 --> 00:33:33.370
Kill me.

00:33:46.004 --> 00:33:48.670
I thought so.

00:34:01.937 --> 00:34:07.737
What a pain in the
ass this thing's been.

00:34:07.770 --> 00:34:11.403
It's you, isn't it?

00:34:11.437 --> 00:34:14.804
We've been looking for
you for a long time.

00:34:14.837 --> 00:34:16.570
Well, you found me.

00:34:16.604 --> 00:34:18.004
But the holy water?

00:34:18.037 --> 00:34:21.470
You think something like that
works on something like me?

00:34:26.570 --> 00:34:28.204
I'm gonna kill you!

00:34:28.238 --> 00:34:32.204
Oh, that would be a neat trick.

00:34:32.238 --> 00:34:35.370
In fact, here.

00:34:35.403 --> 00:34:39.804
Make the gun float to
you there, psychic boy.

00:34:48.704 --> 00:34:50.370
Well, this is fun.

00:34:50.403 --> 00:34:54.537
I could've killed you a
hundred times today, but this...

00:34:56.804 --> 00:34:58.670
This is worth the wait.

00:35:01.871 --> 00:35:07.737
Your dad
- He's in here with me,

00:35:07.770 --> 00:35:10.071
Trapped inside his own meat suit.

00:35:10.104 --> 00:35:12.470
He says "hi," by the way.

00:35:12.503 --> 00:35:14.604
He's gonna tear you apart.

00:35:17.604 --> 00:35:19.338
He's gonna taste the iron in your blood.

00:35:19.370 --> 00:35:21.503
Let him go, or i swear to god -

00:35:21.537 --> 00:35:26.338
What? What are you and god gonna do?

00:35:26.370 --> 00:35:31.104
You see, as far as i'm
concerned, this is justice.

00:35:35.403 --> 00:35:40.037
You know that little exorcism of yours?

00:35:40.071 --> 00:35:42.937
That was my daughter.

00:35:42.971 --> 00:35:44.271
Who, meg?

00:35:44.304 --> 00:35:45.971
The one in the alley?

00:35:48.071 --> 00:35:50.704
That was my boy.

00:35:50.737 --> 00:35:52.204
You understand?

00:35:52.238 --> 00:35:54.171
You've got to be kidding me.

00:35:54.204 --> 00:35:57.004
What? You're the only one
that can have a family?

00:35:57.037 --> 00:36:00.537
You destroyed my children.

00:36:00.570 --> 00:36:03.304
How would you feel if
i killed your family?

00:36:08.770 --> 00:36:12.238
Oh, that's right.

00:36:12.271 --> 00:36:14.271
I forgot. I did.

00:36:16.570 --> 00:36:21.570
Still, two wrongs don't make a right.

00:36:21.604 --> 00:36:24.071
You son of a bitch.

00:36:24.104 --> 00:36:27.637
I want to know why. Why did you do it?

00:36:27.670 --> 00:36:31.238
You mean why did i kill
mommy and pretty, little jess?

00:36:31.271 --> 00:36:32.437
Yeah.

00:36:32.470 --> 00:36:35.604
You know, i never told you this,

00:36:35.637 --> 00:36:38.971
But sam was gonna ask her to marry him.

00:36:39.004 --> 00:36:42.804
Been shopping for rings and everything.

00:36:42.837 --> 00:36:46.004
You want to know why?

00:36:46.037 --> 00:36:48.171
Because they got in the way.

00:36:48.204 --> 00:36:49.737
In the way of what?

00:36:49.770 --> 00:36:51.238
My plans for you, sammy -

00:36:51.271 --> 00:36:55.670
You...and all the children like you.

00:36:55.704 --> 00:36:59.338
Listen, you mind just
getting this over with, huh?

00:36:59.370 --> 00:37:02.004
'Cause i really can't
stand the monologuing.

00:37:02.037 --> 00:37:05.503
Funny, but that's all part
of your m.O., isn't it?

00:37:05.537 --> 00:37:09.904
Mask all that nasty
pain, mask the truth.

00:37:09.937 --> 00:37:12.104
Oh, yeah? What's that?

00:37:12.137 --> 00:37:14.437
You know, you fight, and
you fight for this family,

00:37:14.470 --> 00:37:19.670
But the truth is they don't need you.

00:37:19.704 --> 00:37:21.971
Not like you need them.

00:37:24.004 --> 00:37:28.037
Sam
- He's clearly john's favorite.

00:37:28.071 --> 00:37:30.604
Even when they fight,

00:37:30.637 --> 00:37:33.904
It's more concern than
he's ever shown you.

00:37:36.037 --> 00:37:40.004
I bet you're real proud
of your kids, too, huh?

00:37:40.037 --> 00:37:44.837
Oh, wait, i forgot. I wasted 'em.

00:37:58.537 --> 00:37:59.971
Aah!

00:38:00.004 --> 00:38:02.537
Dean!

00:38:02.570 --> 00:38:04.204
No!

00:38:11.171 --> 00:38:13.704
Dad!

00:38:13.737 --> 00:38:16.770
Dad, don't you let it kill me!

00:38:18.370 --> 00:38:20.004
Dean!

00:38:33.470 --> 00:38:35.604
Dad, please.

00:38:43.470 --> 00:38:44.904
Dean!

00:38:47.104 --> 00:38:49.837
No! Stop.

00:38:51.604 --> 00:38:53.437
Stop it.

00:39:01.238 --> 00:39:05.104
You kill me, you kill daddy.

00:39:05.137 --> 00:39:06.737
I know.

00:39:17.171 --> 00:39:20.137
Dean? Dean? Hey.

00:39:20.171 --> 00:39:21.637
Oh, god, you lost a lot of blood.

00:39:21.670 --> 00:39:23.804
Where's dad?

00:39:23.837 --> 00:39:25.937
He's right here. He's right here, dean.

00:39:25.971 --> 00:39:30.437
Go check on him.

00:39:38.637 --> 00:39:42.770
Dad?

00:39:42.804 --> 00:39:45.104
Sammy!

00:39:45.137 --> 00:39:48.837
It's still alive. It's
inside me. I can feel it.

00:39:48.871 --> 00:39:50.004
You shoot me.

00:39:50.037 --> 00:39:53.503
You shoot me! You shoot
me in the heart, son!

00:39:53.537 --> 00:39:56.071
Do it, now!

00:39:56.104 --> 00:39:57.904
Sam, don't you do it. Don't you do it.

00:39:57.937 --> 00:39:59.338
You've got to hurry.

00:39:59.370 --> 00:40:01.271
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:01.304 --> 00:40:04.437
You shoot me, son! Shoot me!

00:40:04.470 --> 00:40:07.670
Son, i'm begging you! We
can end this here and now!

00:40:08.837 --> 00:40:11.470
Sammy, you kill me!

00:40:11.503 --> 00:40:12.637
Sam, no.

00:40:12.670 --> 00:40:15.370
You do this!

00:40:15.403 --> 00:40:17.937
Sammy!

00:40:17.971 --> 00:40:21.304
Sam, sam...

00:40:25.338 --> 00:40:27.271
I'm begging you, son. You've got to.

00:40:27.304 --> 00:40:30.338
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:30.370 --> 00:40:32.238
Shoot me!

00:40:58.204 --> 00:41:01.671
Look, just hold on, all right?

00:41:01.704 --> 00:41:05.037
The hospital is only 10 minutes away.

00:41:05.070 --> 00:41:08.804
I'm surprised at you, sammy.
Why didn't you kill it?

00:41:08.838 --> 00:41:11.137
I thought we saw
eye-To-Eye on this.

00:41:11.170 --> 00:41:12.704
Killing this demon comes first -

00:41:12.737 --> 00:41:15.404
Before me, before everything.

00:41:17.970 --> 00:41:21.871
No, sir, not before everything.

00:41:21.904 --> 00:41:25.070
Look, we've still got the colt.

00:41:25.103 --> 00:41:26.737
We still have the one bullet left.

00:41:26.771 --> 00:41:28.571
We just have to start over, all right?

00:41:28.604 --> 00:41:29.938
We already found the demon -



00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
